"""
Corporate Reconciliation Engine - Micro-SaaS Prototype
=======================================================
Single-file Gradio app for bank-to-invoice reconciliation with
fuzzy matching, discrepancy reporting, and audit-ready PDF output.

Author: Conrad CJ Wilson
"""

